"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs||[]).push([[3148],{4247(e,t,o){e.exports=o.p+"assets/img/customer-follow-vendor-product-page.ddc7d8a2.png"},75002(e,t,o){o.r(t),o.d(t,{comp:()=>a,data:()=>d});var l=o(20641),s=o(4247);const r=o.p+"assets/img/vendor-shop-followers-dashboard.08c937ad.png",n=o.p+"assets/img/vendor-shop-followers-notification-modal.804c701b.png",i={},a=(0,o(66262).A)(i,[["render",function(e,t){return(0,l.uX)(),(0,l.CE)("div",null,t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,l.Fv)('<h1 id="vendor-shop-followers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-shop-followers"><span>Vendor Shop Followers</span></a></h1><p>The <strong>Vendor Shop Followers</strong> feature allows vendors to engage directly with buyers who follow their shop by sending notifications and updates.</p><p>Building a loyal customer base is essential for marketplace success. With this feature, buyers can follow their favorite marketplace stores with a single click, while vendors gain a direct communication channel to broadcast new arrivals, seasonal promotions, and shop announcements.</p><hr><h2 id="shop-followers-overview" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#shop-followers-overview"><span>Shop Followers Overview</span></a></h2><ul><li>Buyers can follow a vendor’s shop directly from the <strong>product page</strong>.</li><li>A buyer becomes a shop follower by clicking the <strong>heart-shaped icon</strong> on the product page.</li></ul><h3 id="how-buyers-follow-a-store" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#how-buyers-follow-a-store"><span>How Buyers Follow a Store</span></a></h3><p>To follow a vendor&#39;s shop, buyers interact with the product page:</p><ol><li><strong>Log into Customer Account</strong>: The buyer must be logged in to an active customer account. The follow icon is hidden for guest visitors and the vendor themselves.</li><li><strong>Locate the Heart Icon</strong>: On any single product page, the heart-shaped icon appears right next to the vendor&#39;s store link under the product details.</li><li><strong>Click to Follow</strong>: <ul><li>Clicking the heart icon adds the vendor to the customer&#39;s favorite stores list.</li><li>The heart icon immediately highlights to indicate the followed status.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Click to Unfollow</strong>: Clicking the highlighted heart icon again removes the vendor from the buyer&#39;s favorite list.</li></ol><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-follow-vendor-product-page.png"><img src="'+s+'" alt="Customer Follow Vendor on Product Page"></a></p><hr><h2 id="buyer-experience-managing-favorite-vendors" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#buyer-experience-managing-favorite-vendors"><span>Buyer Experience: Managing Favorite Vendors</span></a></h2><p>Buyers can easily keep track of all the shops they follow through their customer account portal:</p><ol><li>Navigate to <strong>My Account</strong> on the storefront.</li><li>Click on the <strong>My Favorite Vendors</strong> menu item.</li><li>In this section, buyers can: <ul><li>View all stores they are currently following.</li><li>Click any vendor store name to visit their shop page directly.</li><li>Remove vendors from their favorites by checking the box and clicking the delete button.</li></ul></li></ol><hr><h2 id="manage-shop-followers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#manage-shop-followers"><span>Manage Shop Followers</span></a></h2><ul><li>Vendors can view all their shop followers under the <strong>Shop Followers</strong> section in the vendor dashboard.</li><li>This section displays the complete list of followers associated with the vendor’s shop.</li></ul><h3 id="accessing-the-shop-followers-dashboard" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#accessing-the-shop-followers-dashboard"><span>Accessing the Shop Followers Dashboard</span></a></h3><p>Vendors can manage their follower community directly from the seller console:</p><ol><li>Log into the <strong>Seller Dashboard</strong>.</li><li>From the sidebar navigation, select <strong>Shop Followers</strong> (accessible at <code>/seller/vendor-shop-followers/</code>).</li><li>The page presents a dedicated management table with quick actions, real-time search, and sorting controls.</li></ol><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendor-shop-followers-dashboard.png"><img src="'+r+'" alt="Vendor Shop Followers Dashboard"></a></p><hr><h3 id="top-action-controls" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#top-action-controls"><span>Top Action Controls</span></a></h3><p>Above the follower table, vendors have two primary action buttons:</p><ul><li><strong>Delete Follower (Trash Icon)</strong>: Allows vendors to permanently remove one or more selected followers from their list in bulk.</li><li><strong>Send Notification (Bell Icon)</strong>: Opens the email broadcast composer to send updates to all selected followers.</li></ul><hr><h3 id="search-and-sort-followers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#search-and-sort-followers"><span>Search and Sort Followers</span></a></h3><p>Vendors with large customer followings can quickly find and organize their follower list using the built-in toolbar:</p><ul><li><strong>Search Followers</strong>: Enter a customer name or email address in the search box to find specific followers instantly.</li><li><strong>Sort By</strong>: Reorder the followers list using the dropdown menu: <ul><li><strong>Newest first</strong> <em>(Default)</em>: Shows the most recent followers at the top.</li><li><strong>Oldest first</strong>: Displays the earliest followers first.</li><li><strong>Name A-Z</strong>: Arranges followers alphabetically by customer name.</li></ul></li></ul><hr><h3 id="understanding-the-followers-table" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#understanding-the-followers-table"><span>Understanding the Followers Table</span></a></h3><p>The followers table organizes key follower information into clear columns:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Column</th><th style="text-align:left;">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Select Checkbox</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Use the header checkbox to select all followers on the page at once, or use individual row checkboxes for targeted actions.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Customer Name</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Displays an avatar circle with initials and the customer&#39;s full registered name.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Customer Email</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Shows the follower&#39;s registered email address.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Action</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Provides a direct <strong>Remove</strong> link to delete a single follower from your shop&#39;s list.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="hint-container tip"><p class="hint-container-title">Follower Count &amp; Pagination</p><p>Below the table, vendors can see their total follower statistics (e.g., <em>Showing 1 of 1 entries</em>) along with pagination controls when followers span across multiple pages.</p></div><hr><h2 id="send-notifications-to-followers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#send-notifications-to-followers"><span>Send Notifications to Followers</span></a></h2><ul><li>Vendors can send notifications to their shop followers to: <ul><li>Share updates.</li><li>Promote new products.</li><li>Inform about offers or announcements.</li></ul></li><li>To send a notification: <ul><li>Select one or more followers from the list.</li><li>Click on <strong>Send Notification</strong>.</li></ul></li></ul><h3 id="selection-requirement" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#selection-requirement"><span>Selection Requirement</span></a></h3><p>Before clicking <strong>Send Notification</strong>, the vendor must select at least one follower using the table checkboxes:</p><ul><li><strong>Single Follower</strong>: Check the box next to any specific follower row.</li><li><strong>Multiple Followers</strong>: Check the boxes for multiple selected followers.</li><li><strong>All Followers</strong>: Click the top checkbox in the table header to select all followers currently displayed.</li></ul><div class="hint-container note"><p class="hint-container-title">Selection Validation</p><p>If you click <strong>Send Notification</strong> without checking any follower box, an alert prompt will appear: <em>&quot;Please select some data to proceed.&quot;</em></p></div><hr><h2 id="notification-popup" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#notification-popup"><span>Notification Popup</span></a></h2><ul><li>A popup window appears to enter the notification details.</li><li>After entering the required information: <ul><li>Click <strong>Send Mail</strong> to dispatch the notification email to the selected followers.</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendor-shop-followers-notification-modal.png"><img src="'+n+'" alt="Send Notification Popup Modal"></a></p><h3 id="modal-fields-and-features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#modal-fields-and-features"><span>Modal Fields and Features</span></a></h3><p>The <strong>Send Notification</strong> popup includes the following elements to help you compose effective emails:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Element</th><th style="text-align:left;">Type</th><th style="text-align:left;">Purpose &amp; Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Header &amp; Close</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Title &amp; Button</td><td style="text-align:left;">Displays the modal heading <strong>Send Notification</strong> and a close icon (<code>×</code>) to cancel at any time.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Introductory Text</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Guidance</td><td style="text-align:left;">Explains: <em>&quot;Email the followers you selected. They will receive it from your store.&quot;</em></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Recipient Counter</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Dynamic Counter</td><td style="text-align:left;">Displays the exact audience size (e.g., <em>&quot;Sending to 1 selected follower(s)&quot;</em>), so you always know who will receive the email.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Subject</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Text Input <em>(Required)</em></td><td style="text-align:left;">Enter the email subject line (e.g., <em>&quot;Exclusive Weekend Sale: 20% Off All Items&quot;</em>). If left empty, an error warning alerts <em>&quot;Subject field cannot be empty.&quot;</em></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Message</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Textarea <em>(Required)</em></td><td style="text-align:left;">Enter your announcement, discount code, product launch details, or personalized message. If left empty, an error warning alerts <em>&quot;Message field cannot be empty.&quot;</em></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Send Mail</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Action Button</td><td style="text-align:left;">Dispatches the email notification directly to all chosen followers from your vendor store.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>After sending, a confirmation message alerts that the email was dispatched successfully.</p><hr><h2 id="vendor-staff-permissions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-staff-permissions"><span>Vendor Staff Permissions</span></a></h2><p>If you use the <strong>Vendor Staff</strong> management feature to delegate store operations to team members, you can assign granular permissions for the Shop Followers section:</p><ul><li><strong>View followers</strong>: Permits staff members to view the shop followers table, search customers, and sort entries.</li><li><strong>Remove followers</strong>: Allows staff members to delete followers individually or via bulk actions.</li><li><strong>Send notification to followers</strong>: Grants permission to open the notification modal and broadcast emails to shop followers.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="benefits" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#benefits"><span>Benefits</span></a></h2><ul><li>Helps vendors build stronger relationships with customers.</li><li>Improves engagement through direct communication.</li><li>Enables quick promotion of products and updates.</li><li>Increases repeat sales with zero extra marketing costs.</li><li>Provides immediate reach for store-wide announcements, new inventory, and seasonal promotions.</li></ul><hr>',57)]))}]]),d=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/vendor-shop-followers.html","title":"Vendor Shop Followers – User Guide","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Vendor Shop Followers – User Guide","description":"Complete user guide for WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace vendors and buyers on using the Shop Followers feature. Learn how buyers follow favorite stores, how vendors manage follower lists, filter and sort followers, and send targeted email notifications.","head":[["meta",{"name":"keywords","content":"woocommerce vendor shop followers, marketplace shop followers, follow vendor store, favorite seller woocommerce, send notifications to followers, vendor follower management, marketplace customer engagement"}],["meta",{"property":"og:title","content":"Vendor Shop Followers – User Guide | WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace"}],["meta",{"property":"og:description","content":"Learn how buyers follow vendor stores and how marketplace vendors manage followers, search and sort lists, and send bulk email updates in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace."}],["meta",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}]]},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Shop Followers Overview","slug":"shop-followers-overview","link":"#shop-followers-overview","children":[{"level":3,"title":"How Buyers Follow a Store","slug":"how-buyers-follow-a-store","link":"#how-buyers-follow-a-store","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Buyer Experience: Managing Favorite Vendors","slug":"buyer-experience-managing-favorite-vendors","link":"#buyer-experience-managing-favorite-vendors","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Manage Shop Followers","slug":"manage-shop-followers","link":"#manage-shop-followers","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Accessing the Shop Followers Dashboard","slug":"accessing-the-shop-followers-dashboard","link":"#accessing-the-shop-followers-dashboard","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Top Action Controls","slug":"top-action-controls","link":"#top-action-controls","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Search and Sort Followers","slug":"search-and-sort-followers","link":"#search-and-sort-followers","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Understanding the Followers Table","slug":"understanding-the-followers-table","link":"#understanding-the-followers-table","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Send Notifications to Followers","slug":"send-notifications-to-followers","link":"#send-notifications-to-followers","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Selection Requirement","slug":"selection-requirement","link":"#selection-requirement","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Notification Popup","slug":"notification-popup","link":"#notification-popup","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Modal Fields and Features","slug":"modal-fields-and-features","link":"#modal-fields-and-features","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Vendor Staff Permissions","slug":"vendor-staff-permissions","link":"#vendor-staff-permissions","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Benefits","slug":"benefits","link":"#benefits","children":[]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/vendor-shop-followers.md"}')}}]);